<translation id="2269053214123323740">Tizim audiosini ulashish uchun Tizim sozlamalarini ochib, João Browser uchun “Faqat tizim audiosini yozib olish” ruxsatini bering. Keyin João Browser qayta ishga tushirilishi kerak.</translation>
