<translation id="7479848806300971661">Ishni kelgan joyidan davom ettiring: João Browser har safar qayta ishga tushganda oxirgi varaqlarni tiklashi mumkin. Faolsizlantirish uchun bu yerga kiring:</translation>
<translation id="1258077876605261365">João Browserga parollarni import qilish</translation>
<translation id="5293062713751091377">1. Quyida <ph name="BUTTON_LABEL" /> tugmasini bosing
2. Windows sozlamalarida <ph name="BUTTON_2" /> tugmasini bosing
3. Tezkor kirish uchun João Browserni vazifalar paneliga mahkamlash uchun Windows bildirishnomasida <ph name="BUTTON_3" /> tugmasini bosing</translation>
